<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Takeuchi’s Information Criteria as a Generalization Measure 
<br class="ltx_break">for Deep Neural Networks Close to the NTK Regime</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Hiroki Naganuma
