<section id="A4.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.5 </span>Experiments with <math id="A4.SS5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d/n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d/n</annotation></semantics></math> Changes within TinyMNIST</h3>

<div id="A4.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We created a restricted dataset, SmallTinyMNIST, which uses only 5% of the TinyMNIST data.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T12" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Additional problem settings are highlighted in bold text</figcaption>
<table id="A4.T12.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A4.T12.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
